, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e● \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(26, 26, 26)\\\"\u003e完成任务「魔女的课业·题解」，还可以从菲谢尔、砂糖、雷泽三名角色中自选邀约一位加入队伍。\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(194, 84, 99)\\\"\u003e玩法开放期间仅能自选邀请一次角色。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8979","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"玩法简述","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"multi_table","layout":"","data":"{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"魔女的礼物 | 魔导角色大揭秘\",\"header\":[\"\"],\"row\":[[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/12/03/50494840/bbfe535af25fe3a567956bc7bc391511_6237026965278610675.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"690\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 690px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/12/03/50494840/bbfe535af25fe3a567956bc7bc391511_6237026965278610675.png\\\" style=\\\"width: 690px;\\\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e旅行者好呀！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e为了应对无法预测的未来，魔女们为伙伴准备了神秘的礼物…让我们掀开礼物包装的一角，看看都有什么吧~\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-view\\\" data-image-url=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/12/03/50494840/a53241431c5779a688555ce5125b5219_2032905249583242393.png\\\" data-image-unit=\\\"px\\\" data-image-width=\\\"1080\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-image-wrapper\\\" style=\\\"width: 1080px;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"\\\"\u003e\u003cimg class=\\\"custom-image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/12/03/50494840/a53241431c5779a688555ce5125b5219_2032905249583242393.png\